    771  f0f1							; --- Per-band ball gate (Phase 3): BandTab[row] $ff/$00 → ENABL ---
    772  f0f1							; Takes the slot of the per-band `lda Temp / sta COLUBK` (VBL writes
    773  f0f1							; COLUBK once now) — same position, +1c (7c gate vs 6c pair), PF2 shifts
    774  f0f1							; c61→c62 (later = right half keeps OLD band even longer, thin-yellow fix
    775  f0f1							; intact). TIA latches ENABL per line: set on this setup line → ball on
    776  f0f1							; from the band's first body line; water + HUD inherit row2's value
    777  f0f1							; (.AfterRows clears ENABL before the HUD band; the HUD bar enables
    778  f0f1							; its own ball).
    779  f0f1		       b5 ed		      lda	BandTab,X
