   3444  fda3							; BuildColupF — 12-byte final COLUPF image at ColupfBuf ($E7-$F2).
   3445  fda3							;   Stripe: rows 0,2 = LevelWallColor; row 1 = LevelWallColor2.
   3446  fda3							;   Hot rows overwrite with TickCounter-bit4 pulse (COLOR_HOT_Y/R).
   3447  fda3							;   $F0-$F2 (bombs) NO LONGER overlap-saved: body writes rows 0-2 only,
   3448  fda3							;   save/restore round trip deleted (S3.0b — window audit: zero writers).
   3449  fda3							;   Bank1 clobbers $E0-$EF during HUD; VBLANK rebuilds every frame.
   3450  fda3							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3451  fda3							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3452  fda3							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   3453  fda3							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   3454  fda3							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF6 always
   3455  fda3							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   3456  fda3							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   3457  fda3							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   3458  fda3							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   3459  fda3							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
   3460  fda3							;   in S3.0b.
   3461  fda3							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3462  fda3
   3463  fda3							; UpdateBombSound moved to bank1 (leaf_move_plan batch A) — CallPad_UpdateBombSound.
