   3521  fdde							;   B = boots together (passing pose, rows 10-11 = cols 3+4)
   3522  fdde							; Legs rows 7-9 identical in both — only the boots move. Standing forces
   3523  fdde							; PlayerSpriteA; walk cycle alternates A<->B every 8 frames (EnemyRamP&$08,
