   3830  ff5e		       d0 3a		      bne	.LaserInit
   3831  ff60							; --- travel: +/-4 px toward the facing (PlayerDir live), capped at the
   3832  ff60							; old S3 sweep extent (SweepOff max 16: right tip <= RoomX+20, left
   3833  ff60							; floor max(RoomX-20,0)) — past the cap restarts at the eye, the
   3834  ff60							; triangle-loop feel of the sweep (user: beam "moved way beyond the
   3835  ff60							; limit"). RectCount = free scratch (LWC re-owns it for its row walk).
   3836  ff60				   .LAdvStep
   3837  ff60		       a4 82		      ldy	PlayerDir
