   3933  ffe6							; jmp operand is fetched from bank1's image at the same PC (FoldIndirect
   3934  ffe6							; discipline). The bank1 body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8) -> rts back to the
   3935  ffe6							; bank0 jsr. Ends $FFEB — $FFF2-$FFF9 stay fill (F6 hotspot mirrors).
   3936  ffe6							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
