   3954  fff2							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3955  fff2							; LaserHitTest — MOVED to bank2 (S5.4, entry tramp $FE86 -> `jmp $FF00`).
   3956  fff2							;   Fold-free: enemy records are level data in bank2 (direct (FetchPtr),Y),
   3957  fff2							;   and the kill/lamp ACTIONS cannot run from a bank2 body (CallPads are
   3958  fff2							;   bank0->bank1 only — pads cannot nest from a pad body). Body returns a
   3959  fff2							;   RESULT CODE in A (+Z preserved through ReturnPad's sta/rts): 0 = miss,
   3960  fff2							;   #$50 = kill (dead bit already set), 1 = lamp. LaserInput's tail does
   3961  fff2							;   `beq / cmp #$50 / jsr CallPad_SetRoomDark | jsr CallPad_AddScore`.
   3962  fff2							;   One less push level too (no fold / no pad call inside the body).
   3963  fff2							;   Full behavior docs moved with the body.
   3964  fff2							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
